{
    "title": "Local Weather: Live Forecast",
    "description": "Your ultimate app for accurate local weather information!\r\nSay goodbye to unpredictable weather and say hello to hassle-free planning! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1eLocal Weather, your personalized weather companion that delivers accurate forecasts no matter where you are or when you need weather information. With our reliable services, you can confidently plan your trips and stay prepared for any weather conditions.\r\n\r\n\u26c5Get up-to-date weather forecasts with hourly and daily updates. Local Weather provides detailed weather information for locations worldwide. You'll find easy-to-understand visuals that show rainfall forecasts, Feels Like temperatures, air quality index (AQI), UV index, humidity levels, visibility, wind direction, wind speed, pressure changes, and more.\r\n\r\n\u26a1 Severe Weather alerts: Receive instant notifications for many kinds of severe weather. Stay informed about high temperatures, rainstorem, thunderstorms, blizzards, floods, and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Detailed weather information\r\nAccess comprehensive weather information for both the current day and the upcoming week. This includes detailed data such as daily temperature, sunrise and sunset times, humidity levels, UV index, and wind reports. Stay informed and prepared with all the essential weather details at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your ultimate app for accurate local weather information!<br>Say goodbye to unpredictable weather and say hello to hassle-free planning! <br><br>\ud83c\udf1eLocal Weather, your personalized weather companion that delivers accurate forecasts no matter where you are or when you need weather information. With our reliable services, you can confidently plan your trips and stay prepared for any weather conditions.<br><br>\u26c5Get up-to-date weather forecasts with hourly and daily updates. Local Weather provides detailed weather information for locations worldwide. You&#39;ll find easy-to-understand visuals that show rainfall forecasts, Feels Like temperatures, air quality index (AQI), UV index, humidity levels, visibility, wind direction, wind speed, pressure changes, and more.<br><br>\u26a1 Severe Weather alerts: Receive instant notifications for many kinds of severe weather. Stay informed about high temperatures, rainstorem, thunderstorms, blizzards, floods, and more.<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Detailed weather information<br>Access comprehensive weather information for both the current day and the upcoming week. This includes detailed data such as daily temperature, sunrise and sunset times, humidity levels, UV index, and wind reports. Stay informed and prepared with all the essential weather details at your fingertips.<br><br>If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us.",
